        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for the quick response @echasnovski! I'll make sure to open an issue first next time. I think there might be a problem with the approach of using a custom key bind for this though, which is there may be multiple attempts to create a custom bind for esc. I was hoping to get this `on_key` approach for this one in here so that it could be independently handled without overwriting/being overwritten by other mappings",
