            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I think there might be a problem with the approach of using a custom key bind for this though, which is there may be multiple attempts to create a custom bind for esc.\r\n\r\nThere is currently a solution within 'mini.nvim' via [linked `MiniKeymap.map_multistep()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/18889a4993a2c6de64eb07f91e7ad8666793441a/doc/mini-jump.txt#L113). The 'mini.jump' behavior can be done via a separate step inside a single `<Esc>` mapping done by the user.",
